def author(register,source,compact):
 compact('b136','用流變、含水與體積收支評估土壓平衡潛盾改良土的功能~Assess EPB conditioned-ground function through rheology, moisture and volume accounting',['herrenknecht-epb','geo'],r'''
塑性土塞的功能~Function of the plastic soil plug||土壓平衡依靠倉內改良土傳遞支護並容許受控出土，材料同時需要可塑性與低滲透。過乾會難以攪拌，過稀則難形成壓降，因此不能把流動性越高當成越好的改良。~EPB chamber material must transmit support while permitting controlled extraction, requiring plasticity and limited permeability together. Dry material resists mixing while overly fluid material may not sustain a pressure drop, so maximum flowability is not the objective.||假設螺旋機長8 m、兩端壓差160 kPa，平均梯度20 kPa/m；僅描述量測，不是允許設定。~Assume an 8 m screw with a 160 kPa end-to-end pressure difference; the mean gradient is 20 kPa/m, describing a measurement rather than an operating setting.||將代表性土樣的流動性、滲透與螺旋機壓力分布一起比較，記錄含水及粒徑；只有可維持壓力傳遞且出土穩定的試驗組合才供工程審查，不能靠單一坍度值認定合格。~Compare workability and permeability of representative samples with screw pressure distribution, recording moisture and grading; engineering review needs stable pressure transmission and extraction rather than acceptance from slump alone.||過度液化可能出現壓力快速流失，乾硬土團則造成間歇堵塞和扭矩跳升；兩種相反狀態都可能以平均出土量正常掩蓋，需看時間歷程。~Overfluid material can lose pressure rapidly, while stiff lumps cause intermittent blockage and torque spikes. Both can hide behind a normal average discharge, requiring time-resolved interpretation.
含水率基準轉換~Moisture-basis conversion||土壤含水率通常以水重除乾土重，與水占濕土總重比例不同。改良效果與黏土礦物及原水量有關，必須先統一質量基準再比較添加量，否則看似相同百分比其實不是同一材料。~Geotechnical moisture content divides water mass by dry soil mass, unlike wet-mass fraction. Conditioning depends on mineralogy and initial water, requiring a consistent mass basis before comparing addition percentages or material behavior.||假設乾土1000 kg、水250 kg，w=25%；水占濕土1250 kg的比例為20%，兩者不可混用。~Assume dry soil 1000 kg and water 250 kg; moisture content is 25%, while water is 20% of the 1250 kg wet mass.||以烘乾或適用快速方法核對水量，將原土含水、加水和其他液體分欄；抽樣位置與時間需對齊出土資料，設計者只有在基準和代表性清楚後才比較不同配比試驗。~Check water using drying or an appropriate rapid method and separate original moisture, added water and other liquids; align sampling location and time with discharge before designers compare trial mixtures on a common representative basis.||把濕基百分比當乾基會錯估改良水量，倉內土與皮帶土失水程度不同又造成比較偏差；誤差可能被錯怪為添加劑性能不穩定。~Confusing wet and dry bases misstates conditioning water, while chamber and belt samples may lose different amounts. The resulting inconsistency can be wrongly attributed to unstable additive performance.
泡沫體積與壓縮~Foam volume and compression||泡沫含大量可壓縮氣體，地面量測體積進入加壓土倉後會縮小，故體積比需說明壓力基準。氣泡穩定性和土粒吸附另會改變時間行為，理想氣體換算只提供第一層量級檢查。~Foam contains compressible gas, so atmospheric volume shrinks in a pressurized chamber and every volumetric ratio needs a pressure reference. Stability and particle interaction add time effects beyond a first-order ideal-gas check.||假設等溫理想氣體由絕對壓100增至300 kPa，初始氣體3 m³縮至1 m³；液相體積未計。~Assume isothermal ideal gas compressed from absolute 100 to 300 kPa; 3 m³ becomes 1 m³, excluding liquid volume.||核對流量計量測位置、壓力種類及泡沫氣液比例，使用合格試驗觀察加壓後的穩定性；所有體積比附標準狀態，不能把常壓泡沫量直接當倉內有效體積。~Check meter location, pressure convention and gas-liquid proportion and assess pressurized stability through qualified testing; attach reference conditions to volume ratios rather than equating atmospheric foam volume with effective chamber volume.||使用表壓代替絕對壓會造成嚴重壓縮換算錯誤，忽略破泡又會高估可用氣泡；控制系統以錯誤體積基準比較時可能誤判材料不足或過量。~Using gauge instead of absolute pressure corrupts compression calculations, while ignored collapse overstates available bubbles. A control comparison on the wrong volume basis can falsely indicate shortage or excess conditioning.
粒徑與細料作用~Grading and fines behavior||細料影響漿體連續性與滲透，大顆粒則影響攪拌和通過能力，但相同細料百分比的礦物活性可以不同。級配分析應連到塑性與磨蝕性，不能以一條粒徑曲線決定全部改良需求。~Fines affect matrix continuity and permeability while coarse particles affect mixing and passage. Equal fines percentages can have different mineral activity, so grading must be linked to plasticity and abrasivity rather than determining conditioning alone.||假設乾樣2 kg中通過指定篩0.6 kg，細料比例30%；篩孔尺寸必須一併註明。~For an assumed 2 kg dry sample with 0.6 kg passing a specified sieve, fines content is 30%; the sieve aperture must accompany the value.||保存篩分、沉降與塑性試驗方法，對不同地層分別取樣並檢查粗粒是否在取樣時被排除；代表性評估需覆蓋過渡帶，試驗主管確認樣本能反映實際進倉土。~Document grading and plasticity methods, sampling layers separately and checking whether coarse particles were excluded during collection; include transition zones and obtain laboratory review of representativeness for chamber material.||只取細膩易裝袋土會漏掉粗礫與硬塊，試驗流變因此過度理想；碰到混合面時堵塞或磨耗突然增加，原先配比試驗便無法解釋。~Sampling only easily bagged fine soil misses gravel and blocks, producing unrealistically favorable workability. Sudden blockage or wear in mixed ground then lies outside the original trial's representation.
流變屈服與黏度~Yield stress and viscosity||改良土可能需超過屈服應力才開始流動，之後流動阻力仍隨剪切速率改變。單點黏度不能代表整條流動曲線，且停放後觸變恢復使重新啟動條件不同於持續攪拌。~Conditioned ground may require a yield stress before flowing and then resist flow differently with shear rate. One viscosity value cannot represent the curve, and thixotropic recovery during rest makes restart differ from continued mixing.||假設Bingham示意τy=2 kPa、μp=0.5 kPa·s、剪率4 s⁻¹，τ=τy+μpγ̇=4 kPa。~For assumed Bingham values τy=2 kPa, μp=0.5 kPa·s and shear rate 4 s⁻¹, τ=τy+μpγ̇=4 kPa.||在適合粗粒尺度的試驗裝置量測多剪率及停放再啟動曲線，記錄溫度和歷程；比較模型殘差與重複性，只有校準範圍內才可用該式描述，不能直接換算機器扭矩指令。~Measure multiple shear rates and rest-restart curves in equipment appropriate to particle size, recording temperature and history; use the model only within calibrated behavior and never convert it directly into a machine torque instruction.||把停放後的高屈服應力當成永久變稠會導致錯誤添加，反之持續攪拌試驗又可能低估重啟阻力；缺乏歷程的數字沒有可比較意義。~Treating post-rest yield increase as permanent thickening can prompt incorrect additions, while continuously mixed tests understate restart resistance. Values without shear history are not meaningfully comparable.
扭矩功率與能耗~Torque power and energy||刀盤功率等於扭矩乘角速度，能源變化可提示磨耗、黏附或材料改良差異，但也受地層強度和推進量影響。將能耗按開挖體積規一化才能做較公平的比較，仍不能單獨確定成因。~Cutterhead power is torque times angular speed. Changes may indicate wear, adhesion or conditioning, but also strength and penetration. Volume-normalized energy improves comparison without uniquely identifying the cause.||假設扭矩1 MN·m、轉速2 rpm，P=T×2πn/60=209.4 kW；非額定能力或推薦轉速。~For assumed torque 1 MN·m and speed 2 rpm, P=T×2πn/60=209.4 kW; these are neither ratings nor recommended settings.||同步扭矩、轉速、推進、地質與改良材料紀錄，剔除空轉及維修段後比較單位體積能量；任何效率結論需同時檢查壓力穩定與沉陷，不能用低功率作唯一最佳化目標。~Synchronize torque, speed, advance, geology and conditioning records, excluding idle and maintenance periods before comparing energy per volume; efficiency conclusions must also check pressure and settlement rather than minimizing power alone.||低功率可能來自低進尺而非改良成功，高功率也可能是新硬層而非泡沫不足；若無地質和產量校正，控制調整會追逐錯誤訊號。~Low power may reflect reduced excavation rather than successful conditioning, and high power may reflect harder ground rather than insufficient foam. Without geology and production correction, adjustments chase the wrong signal.
添加收支與混合均勻~Addition balance and mixing uniformity||添加物總量不代表全倉分布均勻，噴口阻塞或混合死角會造成局部乾團與稀漿並存。收支需按時間與原土體積對齊，並以多位置樣本檢查離散，不能只看泵浦累計量。~Total additive volume does not prove uniform chamber distribution. Blocked delivery or dead zones can leave dry lumps beside dilute slurry. Align quantities with original-soil volume and time and check spatial variability, not only pump totals.||假設一段原土40 m³加入液體2 m³，體積比5%；此示意不指定任何材料配方。~An assumed 2 m³ of liquid added to 40 m³ of original ground gives a 5% ratio; this illustration specifies no material recipe.||以儲槽變化和流量計交叉核對添加量，檢查輸送延遲與管線殘留；多點抽樣比較含水和可塑性，異常分布須先查設備路徑，再由專業團隊評估試驗配比。~Cross-check additions using tank levels and meters and account for delivery delay and retained line contents; compare moisture and workability across samples, investigating delivery paths before specialists reconsider trial proportions.||總量達標但部分噴口失效仍會造成局部失控，時間對錯環則使每環比值失真；將差異全歸於土質可能掩蓋可修復的設備問題。~Adequate totals with failed outlets still produce local problems, and assigning delayed delivery to the wrong ring distorts ratios. Blaming all variability on soil can conceal a correctable equipment fault.
滲透與壓力保持~Permeability and pressure retention||改良土的低滲透性有助於保持壓差，但試驗有效性取決於孔隙結構、壓密和氣泡狀態。過低流量也可能是裝置堵塞，不能把所有零讀值都解讀成理想材料，應確認量測下限。~Limited permeability helps sustain pressure difference, but testing depends on pore structure, compaction and gas state. Near-zero flow can also mean apparatus blockage, so instrument detection limits and continuity require verification.||假設k=10⁻⁷ m/s、面積0.01 m²、梯度10，Q=10⁻⁸ m³/s=0.0006 L/min，需足夠量測靈敏度。~Assume k=10⁻⁷ m/s, area 0.01 m² and gradient 10; Q=10⁻⁸ m³/s=0.0006 L/min, requiring sufficient sensitivity.||使用適用低流量量測與空白裝置查核，觀察試體壓密和排氣歷程；結果附壓差、時間、密度及重複性，未達檢出限以界限報告，不把測不到寫成真正零滲透。~Check low-flow sensitivity and a blank apparatus while observing compaction and gas release; report pressure, duration, density and repeatability, expressing below-detection results as bounds rather than true zero permeability.||裝置堵塞可產生極佳的假低滲透，氣泡壓縮則造成初期流量遲滯；若據此認為任何停機都能保持壓力，會把實驗假象當現場保障。~Apparatus blockage creates falsely excellent low permeability, and bubble compression delays initial flow. Assuming pressure will then persist through any stoppage turns a test artifact into an unjustified field assurance.
老化與環境相容~Aging and environmental compatibility||改良材料在土中會受時間、溫度、水質與吸附影響，短時工作性未必維持到運輸或處理。工程性能與廢土處理相互關聯，應使用經核准的相容性和環境資料，而非只追求瞬間低扭矩。~Time, temperature, water chemistry and adsorption change conditioned material, so immediate workability may not persist through handling or treatment. Engineering behavior and spoil management are linked and require approved compatibility and environmental evidence.||假設同法試驗初始流動指標100、2 h後80，保留比例80%；這是任意指標示例而非材料規格。~An assumed identical-method flow index falling from 100 to 80 after 2 h has 80% retention; this arbitrary index is not a material specification.||在代表性水質與溫度下做時間序列試驗，保留材料批號及合規文件，將土倉與廢土處理需求一起審查；任何產品使用由專業團隊依現場核准方案決定，本課不提供化學配方。~Run time-series tests at representative temperature and water chemistry with batch and compliance records, reviewing chamber and spoil-treatment needs together; specialists select products under an approved site plan, without a chemical recipe from this course.||材料短期有效卻在停放後分離會使重啟困難，處理場又可能面臨不相容廢土；只記產品名稱而不記批次和水質，無法追查性能改變。~Material that separates during rest complicates restart and can create incompatible spoil for treatment. Product names without batch and water-chemistry records cannot trace the reason for changed performance.
改良試驗到現場移交~Conditioning trials and field handover||小型試驗提供比較基礎，實際土倉有更大剪切、壓力與停留時間分布，尺度轉移須逐步驗證。交接應保留失敗組合及適用地層，不能只交最佳結果，讓下個班次知道何時原判斷不再成立。~Small trials support comparisons, while a chamber has different shear, pressure and residence-time distributions. Scale transfer requires verification, including unsuccessful trials and applicable ground, so later shifts know when the original interpretation no longer holds.||假設12組試驗中8組符合預定雙重功能要求，比例66.7%；其餘4組仍需保留原因，不能刪除。~If 8 of an assumed 12 trials satisfy predefined dual-function requirements, the proportion is 66.7%; retain reasons for the other 4 rather than deleting them.||交付土樣來源、試驗邊界、量測原檔與地層適用表，現場再核對壓力、出土與沉陷三類證據；改變方案需經地工與設備負責人共同審查，不用學徒算例直接控制機器。~Deliver sample origin, boundaries, raw measurements and applicable ground, then cross-check pressure, discharge and movement in the field; changes require joint geotechnical and equipment review, not direct control from an apprentice calculation.||只挑成功試驗會掩蓋接近失效的邊界，跨地層仍沿用原方案則忽略材料變化；若沒有版本紀錄，性能異常時也無法判明採用哪一組假設。~Reporting only successful trials hides nearby failure boundaries, while transferring them across strata ignores changed material. Without version records, later anomalies cannot be linked to the assumptions actually in use.
''')
 compact('b137','追蹤泥水循環的壓力、固體與能量收支以及分離設備限制~Track pressure, solids and energy balances and separation limits in slurry circuits',['herrenknecht-mixshield','fhwa'],r'''
循環系統與控制邊界~Circuit and control boundaries||泥水迴路把支護、輸送及分離連成系統，送回流量差不只反映開挖量，也包含管路儲存和介質補充。必須在同一時間窗閉合帳目，先界定控制體才可解釋流量異常。~A slurry circuit links support, transport and separation. Supply-return differences include storage and replenishment as well as excavation, so a common time window and defined control volume are essential before interpreting anomalies.||假設送流100 m³/h、回流110 m³/h且儲量不變，淨增加10 m³/h；仍須區分固體與水。~Assume supply 100 m³/h and return 110 m³/h at unchanged storage; net addition is 10 m³/h, still requiring separation of solids and water.||將送回流量、槽位、補水與排放量同步，使用校準流量計及容積測量互查；短期差額需先扣儲存，長期不閉合才結合地質與機器狀態查漏失或非預期流入。~Synchronize supply, return, tank levels, makeup and discharge and cross-check calibrated meters against volumes; correct short-term storage before investigating persistent imbalance with geological and machine evidence.||把槽位下降誤當地層吸漿會錯判風險，回流漏量又可能掩蓋真正進水；只比兩個瞬時數值，無法區分管線暫態與穩態地質反應。~Mistaking falling tank storage for ground loss misclassifies risk, while unmetered returns conceal real inflow. Two instantaneous readings cannot distinguish pipeline transients from steady geological response.
流速與顆粒輸送~Velocity and solids transport||流速影響顆粒是否沉積，也控制摩擦能耗與磨耗，最佳狀態取決於粒徑、濃度及非牛頓特性。平均速度只是起點，彎頭和停流區可局部沉積，不能由一個管段速度保證整線暢通。~Velocity affects deposition, energy and wear, with behavior depending on grading, concentration and non-Newtonian properties. Mean speed is only a starting point because bends and stagnant regions can deposit solids even when one pipe section appears adequate.||假設流量0.25 m³/s、管徑0.4 m，v=4Q/(πD²)=1.989 m/s；非推薦輸送速度。~With assumed Q=0.25 m³/s and D=0.4 m, v=4Q/(πD²)=1.989 m/s; this is not a recommended transport speed.||對照粒徑和固體濃度的合格輸送試驗，檢查彎頭、低點與停機後壓差；流速資料與實際沉積證據並列，由設備工程師評估操作範圍，不直接採用算例速度。~Compare qualified transport trials for grading and concentration and inspect bends, low points and post-stop pressure loss; equipment engineers assess operating range using velocity and actual deposition evidence, not the illustrative speed.||速度不足可能形成沉積床而縮小有效管徑，盲目升速又加劇彎頭磨穿；壓差增加既可能是堵塞也可能是物性變化，需另有證據。~Insufficient velocity forms a deposit bed and reduces area, while indiscriminate speed increase accelerates bend wear. Rising pressure loss can indicate blockage or changed rheology and needs independent evidence.
壓差與泵浦功率~Pressure loss and pump power||泵浦提供克服高程與管路損失的能量，效率把液壓功率轉為軸功率需求。泥水密度與黏度改變會移動工作點，不能只用清水泵曲線推定實際效率或最大可輸送量。~Pumps supply elevation and friction energy, with efficiency relating hydraulic and shaft power. Slurry density and viscosity shift the operating point, so a clear-water curve alone cannot establish actual efficiency or transport capacity.||假設Q=0.2 m³/s、Δp=500 kPa、效率0.75，軸功率QΔp/η=133.3 kW；未含馬達損失。~Assume Q=0.2 m³/s, Δp=500 kPa and efficiency 0.75; shaft power QΔp/η=133.3 kW, excluding motor losses.||同步測流量、吸排壓及電力，核對效率定義與密度，再比較適用泥水條件的性能資料；異常能耗先查磨耗、沉積及物性，不把泵浦額定功率直接等同可用液壓功率。~Synchronize flow, suction-discharge pressure and electricity, checking efficiency definition and density against appropriate slurry performance data; investigate wear, deposits and rheology rather than equating motor rating with available hydraulic power.||忽略效率會低估驅動需求，磨損葉輪可能仍耗電卻輸送不足；若只看馬達運轉，可能錯過流量下降與後續顆粒沉積的連鎖反應。~Ignoring efficiency understates drive demand, and a worn impeller may consume power without adequate transport. Monitoring only motor operation misses declining flow and the resulting chain of solids deposition.
固體質量濃度~Solids mass concentration||泥水密度可估固體體積比例，但須知道液相與顆粒密度且無顯著氣體。質量濃度與體積濃度不同，分離效率與出土量換算使用不同基準時必須明確轉換。~Mixture density can estimate solids volume fraction if liquid and grain densities are known and gas is negligible. Mass and volume fractions differ, requiring explicit conversion when assessing separation or excavated-material quantities.||假設ρm=1200、ρw=1000、ρs=2600 kg/m³，Cv=(1200−1000)/(2600−1000)=0.125；質量分率0.271。~Assume ρm=1200, ρw=1000 and ρs=2600 kg/m³; Cv=0.125 and solids mass fraction Cvρs/ρm=0.271.||以密度計和乾燥固體取樣交叉核對，檢查含氣與顆粒密度差異；報告量測基準、溫度及取樣代表性，若密度推估與實測不符，先查氣體或液相添加而非強制調整土量。~Cross-check density with dried-solids sampling and investigate entrained gas and grain density; document basis, temperature and representativeness, resolving discrepancies before forcing density-derived excavation quantities to match expectations.||把體積濃度當質量濃度會大幅錯估固體產出，含氣又使密度偏低而看似稀漿；錯誤可能導致分離設備負荷及廢土量預估失準。~Confusing volume and mass fractions misstates solids production, while gas reduces measured density and mimics dilution. The error propagates into separator loading and spoil-quantity forecasts.
旋流分離與分級~Cyclone separation and grading||旋流器利用顆粒慣性與流場分級，切割粒徑不是一道所有顆粒都服從的硬邊界。細顆粒仍可能隨底流走，粗粒也可能旁通，需用完整粒徑分配和質量收支描述效率。~Cyclones classify through particle inertia and flow, but cut size is not a perfect boundary. Fines can report to underflow and coarse particles can bypass, requiring size distributions and mass balance rather than one headline efficiency.||假設進料乾固體100 t/h、底流回收80 t/h，總質量回收80%；不等於所有粒徑皆有80%分離率。~For assumed dry-solids feed 100 t/h and underflow recovery 80 t/h, overall recovery is 80%; this does not mean 80% capture at every size.||同時取進料、溢流與底流樣，做流量、濃度和粒徑收支，將粒徑分級效率分開；設備審查需確認採樣時間對齊及濕乾基準，不能只看一側看似乾淨。~Sample feed, overflow and underflow together and close flow, concentration and grading balances; review size-specific efficiency with synchronized wet-dry bases rather than judging one visually clean stream.||進料波動時非同步取樣會製造不可能的效率，細料累積於回用漿又使流變漸變；只追求粗粒回收可能忽略整個循環介質已偏離需求。~Unsynchronized samples during feed changes create impossible efficiency estimates, while recirculating fines progressively alter rheology. Coarse recovery alone can miss a circuit medium drifting away from its required behavior.
槽位與停留時間~Tank levels and residence time||槽體提供緩衝與混合，但理想平均停留時間不代表每個顆粒停留相同。短流與死區使部分介質很快返回、部分長期沉積，槽位正常也可能掩蓋有效容積減少。~Tanks buffer and mix, but average residence time does not apply to every particle. Short circuits return some material rapidly while dead zones retain deposits, so normal level can conceal loss of effective volume.||假設有效槽容60 m³、流量120 m³/h，名義停留0.5 h=30 min；非完整停留時間分布。~With assumed effective volume 60 m³ and flow 120 m³/h, nominal residence time is 0.5 h=30 min, not the full residence-time distribution.||用槽位校準、沉積檢查及合適示蹤試驗評估有效容積，對照進出密度變化的延遲；維護人員記錄清槽前後差異，不能把幾何容積直接當長期可用緩衝量。~Assess effective volume through calibrated level, deposit inspection and suitable tracer work, comparing density-change delays; record before-after cleaning behavior instead of treating geometric tank volume as permanently available buffering.||沉積使有效容積縮小但液位仍正常，遇到流量突變時緩衝不足；短流又讓未充分處理的細料立即返回，造成看似難解的循環品質波動。~Deposits reduce effective volume without changing normal level, weakening transient buffering. Short-circuiting rapidly returns insufficiently treated fines and creates apparently inexplicable variation in circulating slurry quality.
壓力暫態與管路彈性~Pressure transients and pipe elasticity||快速流速變化會與流體可壓縮性及管壁彈性耦合，產生暫態壓力波。含氣、非牛頓介質和支管使簡化水擊關係偏離實際，需分析整個系統而非單一閥前讀值。~Rapid velocity change couples fluid compressibility with pipe-wall elasticity, producing pressure waves. Entrained gas, non-Newtonian behavior and branches complicate a simple water-hammer relation, requiring a system analysis rather than one valve-side reading.||假設變速時間比往返波傳時間2L/a短，示意ρ=1200 kg/m³、a=300 m/s、Δv=0.5 m/s，Δp=ρaΔv=180 kPa；慢變速不直接適用。~Assume velocity changes faster than the round-trip wave time 2L/a; illustrative ρ=1200 kg/m³, a=300 m/s and Δv=0.5 m/s give Δp=180 kPa. Slow changes do not directly satisfy this relation.||以足夠頻率壓力紀錄對照流量事件，將實際管材、支承、含氣及閥件時序帶入專業暫態分析；任何控制變更由設備工程師核准，本課算式不得用來自行操作閥件。~Compare sufficiently fast pressure records with flow events and analyze actual pipe, supports, gas and valve timing professionally; equipment engineers approve changes, and this relation does not authorize valve operation.||低頻取樣可能完全漏掉短壓峰，管路疲勞卻仍累積；把所有尖峰當電噪音刪除會失去重要證據，反之未校驗感測器也可能製造假水擊。~Slow sampling may miss short peaks while fatigue accumulates. Deleting every spike as electrical noise loses evidence, although unverified sensors can also manufacture false transient events requiring independent checks.
磨耗與剩餘厚度~Wear and remaining thickness||固體顆粒撞擊與滑磨使管壁損失，彎頭外側和局部高速區可能先變薄。平均厚度不能代表最低剩餘壁厚，磨耗速率又隨粒徑與流況變化，必須把位置與歷程一起記錄。~Particle impact and abrasion remove wall material, often fastest on outer bends or local high-speed zones. Mean thickness does not represent minimum wall, and changing grading and flow make wear rates time dependent.||假設某點厚度由12降10 mm歷時1000 h，平均磨耗0.002 mm/h；線性外推只在同工況下作情境比較。~An assumed point thinning from 12 to 10 mm over 1000 h averages 0.002 mm/h; linear extrapolation is only a same-condition scenario.||在固定位置做經校準的超音波厚度網格，對照顆粒、速度與更換紀錄，特別保留局部最低值；剩餘可用性由設備工程師依材料、壓力及缺陷規範判定，不能由平均磨耗獨自決定。~Repeat calibrated ultrasonic grids at fixed locations with grading, velocity and replacement records, retaining local minima; equipment engineers assess fitness using material, pressure and defect criteria rather than average wear alone.||量到不同點位會造成假增厚或假加速磨耗，腐蝕與局部沖蝕又可能集中在未量區；只用平均厚度安排維護可能錯過最薄部位。~Changing measurement positions creates false thickening or acceleration, while corrosion and erosion can concentrate outside the sampled grid. Maintenance based on average thickness may miss the limiting local section.
循環可靠度與備援~Circuit availability and redundancy||串聯系統任何關鍵設備失效都可能中斷循環，備用泵存在也不代表可立即切換。可靠度需考慮共用電力、閥件和分離容量，時間利用率則受預防維護與故障停機共同影響。~Any critical series component can interrupt circulation, and a spare pump does not guarantee immediate recovery. Shared power, valves and separation capacity limit redundancy, while planned and unplanned downtime both affect availability.||假設運轉160 h、停機10 h，利用率160/170=94.12%；不是單一元件固有可靠度。~With assumed operation 160 h and downtime 10 h, availability is 160/170=94.12%; it is not an intrinsic component reliability.||以故障樹或系統圖檢查共因失效，測試核准的備援切換與資料紀錄，統計停機原因而不只總時數；維護與施工團隊共同確認失去循環時的既定回應。~Review common-cause failure through a system diagram and test approved backup transitions and logging; classify downtime causes rather than only total duration, with maintenance and construction teams confirming the response to lost circulation.||兩台泵共用同一電源時不能當完全獨立備援，分離廠滿載也會使多泵無法增加產能；若只加總銘牌流量，系統可用性被高估。~Two pumps on one supply are not fully independent backups, and a saturated separation plant limits additional pumping. Adding nameplate capacities therefore overstates achievable system availability and transport capacity.
泥水資料與工程結案~Slurry-data engineering closeout||完整循環帳目讓地層變化、設備退化與處理效能可以回溯，資料只有單位一致並附感測器位置才可整合。結案須保留原始時間序列及校準，不以每班平均取代可能控制風險的暫態。~Complete circuit accounting supports retrospective separation of geology, equipment degradation and treatment behavior. Integration requires consistent units and sensor locations. Retain raw time series and calibration rather than replacing important transients with shift averages.||假設10個流量感測器中9個具完整校準鏈，追溯率90%；關鍵回流計缺失仍須個別處理。~If 9 of an assumed 10 flowmeters have complete calibration chains, traceability is 90%; a missing critical return meter still requires individual resolution.||從一段出土體積追查送回流、密度、槽位與校準原檔，核對時鐘和取樣間隔；業主及設備負責人確認缺漏與剩餘限制後接管，不能用高整體完成率掩蓋關鍵通道缺資料。~Trace one excavation-volume interval to flow, density, levels and calibration, checking clocks and sample intervals; owner and equipment leads accept remaining gaps explicitly rather than allowing a high completion percentage to conceal missing critical channels.||只保留報表圖片會失去重算固體收支的能力，感測器更換後若未換版本則可能拼接出假趨勢；維護和地質分析都會受錯誤歷程影響。~Report images alone cannot support recalculating solids balances, and an unversioned sensor replacement can create an artificial trend. Both maintenance and geological interpretation then inherit the corrupted history.
''')
 source('sika-tbm','潛盾密封與環隙填充材料的系統功能','Solutions for Tunnel Boring Machines','Sika','https://www.sika.com/en/solutions-for-projects/tunnel-boring-machines.html','供應者公開的盾尾刷間密封及背填灌漿用途，提供物理功能背景；不引用產品數字為現場要求。','Supplier explanation of sealing between tail brushes and annular backfill; product numbers are not adopted as field requirements.')
 source('herrenknecht-tools','掘進刀具與刀盤管理','Excavation Tools','Herrenknecht','https://www.herrenknecht.com/?eID=file_download&file=fileadmin%2Fuser_upload%2FMain_Website%2F03_Produkte%2F04_Peripheral_Equipment%2F05_Abbauwerkzeuge%2F02_Content%2FHK3525_DB_Excavation_Tools_8S_EN_20230526_LowRes_Ansicht_Einzelseiten.pdf','製造商刀具種類及刀具管理資料，支持刀盤接觸、磨耗與追溯的背景；不採用專有磨耗配方。','Manufacturer information on cutting tools and management, supporting contact, wear and traceability without proprietary wear recipes.')
 source('segment-gaskets','隧道預鑄環片止水墊','Tunnel Segment Gaskets','Trelleborg Marine and Infrastructure','https://www.trelleborg.com/en/marine-and-infrastructure/products-solutions-and-services/infrastructure/seals/tunnel-segment-gaskets','供應者之鑽掘隧道環片止水墊產品分類與用途；本課另行說明教學假設。','Supplier classification and applications of gaskets for bored-tunnel segments; course values remain separate assumptions.')
 source('hs2-segments','聯絡通道及豎井開口特殊環片設計','Special segment design for cross passages and shaft passages','HS2 Learning Legacy','https://learninglegacy.hs2.org.uk/document/special-segment-design-for-cross-passages-and-shaft-passages/','業主公開的特殊環片與開口受力設計文章，展示施工與永久階段須一起考慮。','Owner-published special segment and opening design, illustrating construction and permanent load-path considerations.')
 source('crossrail-fire','橫貫鐵路預鑄襯砌防火設計','Design of Crossrail’s Precast Tunnel Linings for Fire','Crossrail Learning Legacy','https://learninglegacy.crossrail.co.uk/documents/design-of-crossrails-precast-tunnel-linings-for-fire/','施工工程師公開的預鑄襯砌防火分析與試驗背景；不將案例試驗條件當成所有隧道通則。','Project engineers’ fire analysis and testing context for precast lining, without treating project test conditions as universal.')
 source('vmt-rings','從環片生產至環組裝的品質管理','Quality management from segment production to ring building','VMT','https://vmt.global/tunnelling/en/ring-building/','設備供應者的環片追溯、組環與品質資料背景。','Supplier context for segment traceability, ring building and quality records.')
 source('vmt-navigation','隧道掘進機導航系統','TBM navigation systems','VMT','https://vmt.global/tunnelling/en/tbm/','導航供應者的掘進機定位系統概覽，用於坐標鏈與姿態解釋；不承諾型錄精度。','Navigation supplier overview for position chains and attitude interpretation, without adopting advertised accuracy as guaranteed performance.')
 compact('b138','以盾尾間隙、密封介質與壓力證據診斷盾尾漏水路徑~Diagnose tail-seal leakage through clearance, sealing medium and pressure evidence',['sika-tbm','fhwa'],r'''
多道刷列的阻水機制~Multiple brush-row sealing||盾尾刷列與密封介質共同填住移動盾殼和環片之間的間隙，刷毛本身不是完整防水膜。多道密封提供分段阻力，但共用供應失效或同一幾何缺陷可能同時破壞多列。~Tail brushes and sealing medium fill the moving gap between shield and lining; brushes alone are not an impermeable membrane. Multiple rows add barriers, but shared supply failure or a common geometric defect can defeat them together.||假設3道獨立密封各失效機率0.01，同時失效為10⁻⁶；真實共因失效會使獨立假設失效。~Assume 3 independent barriers each with failure probability 0.01; simultaneous failure is 10⁻⁶, but real common causes invalidate independence.||以系統圖標示刷列、供應線、壓力感測與共用設備，檢查失效是否真正獨立；比對各區消耗及漏水位置，設備主管需審查共因情境，不把多道數量直接換成可靠度保證。~Map rows, supply lines, sensors and shared equipment and test whether failures are independent; compare zone consumption and leakage location, with equipment review of common causes rather than reliability guaranteed by barrier count.||三道刷列若共用堵塞管線可同時失去密封介質，計算出的極低機率便毫無依據；只強調道數會掩蓋真正脆弱的共用節點。~Three rows sharing a blocked supply can lose sealing medium together, invalidating the tiny calculated probability. Emphasizing row count conceals the shared node that actually limits the system.
尾隙與偏心分布~Tail clearance and eccentricity||盾尾環隙沿圓周不均，盾體偏心使一側壓縮而另一側放大。密封需求由最不利局部間隙控制，平均環隙相同不代表刷毛接觸相同，組環姿態和盾體運動需共同考慮。~Tail clearance varies around the circumference. Eccentricity compresses one side and opens the other, so local extremes govern brush contact even with unchanged mean clearance. Ring attitude and shield movement must be considered together.||假設名義徑向間隙40 mm、偏心15 mm，兩側示意間隙25與55 mm；未含橢圓化。~For assumed nominal radial clearance 40 mm and eccentricity 15 mm, opposite clearances are 25 and 55 mm, excluding ovalization.||將實測尾隙、環片姿態與盾體姿態以同一方位繪圖，重點查局部最大最小值；依設備及環片設計核准的幾何界線審查，不能只看平均間隙或單點量測。~Plot clearance, ring pose and shield pose in one angular convention, focusing on maxima and minima; review against approved equipment and lining geometry rather than accepting only an average or one measurement.||偏心大時一側刷毛過度擠壓磨耗、另一側接觸不足，平均值卻可能正常；若只增加密封介質而不查幾何，漏水根因仍保留。~Large eccentricity overcompresses and wears one side while reducing contact on the other, despite a normal mean. Adding medium without checking geometry leaves the cause of leakage unresolved.
密封壓差與高程~Seal differential pressure and elevation||密封面承受外部水與灌漿壓力，內部感測值需修正高程和管線損失才可比較。量到供應端高壓不表示刷列間實際壓力足夠，因為堵塞或黏性損失可消耗大部分壓差。~The seal resists external water and grout, while internal readings require elevation and line-loss correction. High supply-end pressure does not establish cavity pressure because blockage and viscous losses can consume much of the differential.||假設淡水高差30 m，靜水壓差ρgh=294.3 kPa；它不含灌漿暫態且非密封供壓指令。~An assumed fresh-water elevation difference of 30 m gives 294.3 kPa hydrostatic pressure, excluding grout transients and not prescribing seal supply pressure.||核對壓力計位置、零點與介質狀態，對照供應端和靠近密封區的紀錄；設備工程師需判別高壓低流量是否阻塞，任何調整依核准程序，算例只幫助壓力基準換算。~Check sensor position, zero and medium state and compare supply with near-seal records; equipment engineers distinguish blockage indicated by high pressure and low flow, with changes only under approved procedures.||供應管堵塞可呈現高壓但沒有材料到達刷列，若把儀表高值當成功密封，外部水土可能逐步侵入；漏水初期未必伴隨供應壓力降低。~A blocked line shows high pressure without delivering medium. Mistaking that reading for successful sealing permits progressive ingress, which need not initially reduce measured supply pressure at all.
密封消耗與有效補充~Consumption and effective replenishment||密封介質消耗包含隨盾體運動帶走、外漏和填補空隙，單位進尺消耗能作趨勢但不直接證明效果。停機期間的消耗與推進期間意義不同，應區分時間基準與距離基準。~Seal consumption includes movement losses, leakage and filling of voids. Consumption per advance supports trending without proving performance. Standstill consumption differs physically from advancing consumption, requiring both time and distance references.||假設一段消耗120 kg、前進8 m，單位消耗15 kg/m；另一停機時段不能以零進尺計此比值。~Assumed consumption 120 kg over 8 m gives 15 kg/m; the same ratio is undefined for a zero-advance standstill.||以儲桶重量及計量器互核，按刷列分區記錄並對照盾體行程、停機和漏水；異常增加需判斷幾何變化或外漏，不能僅因材料用量高就宣稱密封較可靠。~Cross-check containers and meters by zone against advance, stops and leakage; investigate geometric change or external loss when consumption rises rather than assuming greater material use means greater sealing reliability.||密封材料大量流入外部空隙可能消耗很高卻未建立連續阻水，計量器空打又會虛增用量；只用採購量推估性能會把損失當成功。~Material escaping into external voids can produce high consumption without a continuous barrier, while empty pumping inflates metered use. Procurement quantities alone can confuse material loss with effective sealing.
流變與輸送相容~Rheology and delivery compatibility||密封介質需兼顧可泵送、黏附及抗水沖，溫度改變會同時影響輸送阻力與保持能力。只以黏度高低排序忽略剪切與時間效應，產品相容性及設備適用範圍需由正式試驗確認。~Sealing medium balances pumpability, adhesion and washout resistance. Temperature affects both transport and retention, so viscosity alone misses shear and time effects; compatibility and equipment suitability require qualified testing.||假設管線同流量下壓降由1.0增1.5 MPa，比值1.5；不能直接斷定密封能力也增加50%。~If assumed line loss rises from 1.0 to 1.5 MPa at equal flow, the ratio is 1.5; sealing ability has not thereby increased by 50%.||比較代表溫度下的供應資料和合格流變試驗，記錄材料批號與停留時間；將泵送壓損和抗水試驗分別評估，設備工程師核准相容材料，課程不提供配方或加壓方法。~Compare qualified rheology and supplier evidence at representative temperatures with batch and residence records; assess delivery loss separately from water resistance, leaving material approval to equipment engineers without recipes or pressurization instructions.||低溫變稠可能讓管線壓高而刷列缺料，高溫過軟又可能被水沖失；用同一常溫試驗概括全部工況，會忽略性能的兩端限制。~Cold thickening can raise line pressure while starving the seal, whereas excessive softening in heat permits washout. One ambient test cannot represent both limiting conditions across actual operation.
環片表面與接觸~Segment surface and contact||刷列沿環片外表面滑動，局部缺角、凸起或附著砂漿會改變接觸並磨損刷毛。防水問題因此不僅是密封材料，也包含環片製造與組裝品質，缺陷位置要能追到環號方位。~Brushes slide along segment exteriors, where chips, protrusions and adhered mortar alter contact and wear. Sealing therefore depends on manufacturing and assembly quality as well as medium, requiring defects to be traceable by ring and angle.||假設周長20 m中有0.5 m表面缺陷帶，占2.5%；局部連續缺陷不能按面積比例平均風險。~An assumed 0.5 m defect band along a 20 m circumference is 2.5%; a continuous local defect cannot have its risk averaged by that fraction.||在核准可接近位置查外觀及製造記錄，將缺陷方位與尾隙、漏水及消耗對照；任何修補須符合環片及設備要求，不能讓未審查修補凸起穿過密封刷列。~Inspect accessible surfaces and manufacturing records under approved access, correlating defects with clearance, leakage and consumption; repairs must meet segment and machine requirements before an unreviewed protrusion passes through brushes.||未清除的凸塊可連續損傷多道刷列，缺角又形成局部水路；只處理可見內側漏水而不追外表面缺陷，問題可能在後續環持續出現。~A protrusion may damage several brush rows in sequence, while a chip forms a local path. Treating visible internal leakage without tracing exterior defects can allow the problem to recur on subsequent rings.
灌漿與密封交互作用~Grouting and seal interaction||盾尾外的灌漿填補環隙，也可能對密封施加暫態壓力或讓硬化材料侵入刷列。灌漿與密封系統應協調時間、位置與壓力證據，不能各自看儀表正常就假定介面無問題。~Backfill outside the tail closes the annulus but can load seals transiently or introduce hardening material into brushes. Grout and seal systems need coordinated time, location and pressure evidence rather than isolated normal readings.||假設外部灌漿壓力250 kPa、局部密封腔讀值230 kPa，差20 kPa；此差值只供診斷，非容許界線。~Assumed external grout pressure 250 kPa and local cavity reading 230 kPa differ by 20 kPa; the difference is diagnostic, not an allowable boundary.||同步灌漿口與密封分區資料，核對高程與感測位置並追蹤材料硬化時間；漏水或消耗變化需查是否與特定灌漿事件重合，由灌漿及設備負責人共同審查介面。~Synchronize grout-port and seal-zone records with elevation, sensor location and setting time; investigate whether leakage or consumption changes coincide with specific grouting events, with joint grout and equipment review.||灌漿倒入刷列後硬化會降低柔順接觸，表面暫時止漏卻可能造成後續破壞；不同系統時鐘不一致又會掩蓋兩者的因果關聯。~Grout hardening in brushes reduces compliant contact; temporary apparent sealing can precede later damage. Unsynchronized system clocks further conceal the causal link between grout events and seal deterioration.
漏水量與趨勢判讀~Leakage rate and trend interpretation||可見漏水量受收集範圍、排水混流與壓差影響，不能把排水泵總量全歸盾尾。持續上升或混入細土比單次清水滴漏更需追查，量測應將來源和時間分開。~Observed leakage depends on collection area, mixed drainage and pressure difference; total sump pumping is not all tail leakage. Rising flow or fines warrants distinct investigation, with sources and time explicitly separated.||假設專用收集槽5 min增加30 L，平均漏量6 L/min=0.1 L/s；未分流總排水不適用。~An assumed dedicated tank gaining 30 L in 5 min indicates 6 L/min=0.1 L/s; mixed drainage cannot support the same attribution.||採核准安全方式辨識收集來源，使用計量槽或流量計並記錄濁度與壓差；比對分區密封和施工事件，任何異常依既定應變計畫由負責人處理，不能靠學徒自行追入受壓區。~Identify collection sources under approved safe access and measure flow with turbidity and pressure context; correlate seal zones and events, referring anomalies through the response plan rather than entering pressurized areas independently.||排水槽混入洗滌水可製造假漏水趨勢，細土沉積又可能使流量看似下降但侵蝕仍在；只有水量而無來源與固體證據，不能判斷惡化是否停止。~Wash water creates false leakage trends, while deposited fines can reduce collected flow despite continuing erosion. Flow alone without source and solids evidence cannot establish that deterioration has stopped.
停機保存與劣化~Standstill preservation and deterioration||停機時盾尾仍承受外壓，介質可能被沖失、沉降或隨溫度變化，刷毛也可能被硬化漿體固定。停止前正常不能保證重啟前正常，狀態確認需要看整段停機歷程。~External loading persists during stoppage while medium washes out, settles or changes with temperature, and grout may immobilize brushes. A normal pre-stop state does not guarantee a normal restart state; the complete standstill history matters.||假設停機24 h消耗36 kg，平均1.5 kg/h；此觀測不能轉成通用補充週期或允許停機時限。~Assumed 36 kg consumption during a 24 h standstill averages 1.5 kg/h; it does not prescribe a universal replenishment interval or allowable stop duration.||按設備核准計畫檢查停機期間壓力、消耗與漏水，保留供應中斷及溫度事件；重啟前由設備及施工主管確認幾何和密封證據，不能僅因泵浦可運轉就視為已恢復功能。~Review pressure, consumption and leakage through the approved standstill plan, retaining interruptions and temperature events; equipment and construction leads verify geometry and seal evidence before restart rather than relying on pump operation alone.||供應中斷若被平均耗量掩蓋，密封可能已局部失水，硬化漿體又使刷毛無法跟隨環片；重啟後漏水才暴露，已錯過較早的異常證據。~Average consumption can hide an interruption that dries part of the barrier, while hardened grout prevents brushes following segments. Leakage on restart then reveals damage whose earlier evidence was missed.
密封狀態工程移交~Seal-condition engineering handover||密封系統的剩餘性能不能由道數或使用時間單獨判斷，需結合幾何、消耗、漏水與材料歷程。班次交接保留不一致訊號及限制，才不會把尚待調查的問題當成已修復。~Remaining seal capability cannot be inferred from row count or age alone; geometry, consumption, leakage and material history must agree. Shift handover retains discrepancies and limitations so an unresolved problem is not mistaken for a completed repair.||假設12個監測分區有9個完整資料，覆蓋75%；缺失3區若相鄰，不能視為均勻隨機缺測。~If 9 of an assumed 12 zones have complete records, coverage is 75%; 3 adjacent missing zones are not uniformly random omissions.||逐區核對感測器、材料批號、尾隙及異常處置，抽查一個漏點能否追到環號與時序；設備主管確認剩餘風險和接管責任，所有受壓維護只依專業核准程序執行。~Audit sensors, batches, clearance and responses by zone and trace a leakage point to ring and time; the equipment lead confirms residual risk and handover responsibility, with pressurized maintenance restricted to approved specialist procedures.||未交接的局部缺料可能讓下一班只看總表而誤認正常，更換感測器未重建基準又造成假改善；缺乏版本和位置資訊會直接削弱故障診斷。~Unreported local starvation lets the next shift trust a normal total, while a sensor change without a new baseline creates false improvement. Missing versions and locations directly undermine diagnosis.
''')
 compact('b139','以刀具軌跡、接觸荷重與磨耗證據解釋掘進刀具壽命~Explain cutter life using trajectories, contact loads and wear evidence',['herrenknecht-tools','fhwa'],r'''
刀具半徑與行程~Cutter radius and travel||不同半徑刀具每轉走過不同距離，外緣刀即使承受相同轉數也有較長接觸路徑。磨耗比較須規一化里程或體積並保留刀位，不能用更換次數直接推斷材料品質。~Tools at different radii travel different distances per revolution. Outer cutters therefore accumulate longer contact paths at equal revolutions, requiring wear normalization by travel or excavation and retention of cutter position rather than replacement count alone.||假設刀位半徑5 m、轉速4 rpm，切向速度v=2πrn/60=2.094 m/s；不代表建議轉速。~Assume cutter radius 5 m and rotation 4 rpm; tangential speed v=2πrn/60=2.094 m/s, not a recommended speed.||以刀位圖、轉數及地層日誌計算接觸行程，對照同類刀具的量測磨耗；將外緣與中心刀分組比較，無法追溯位置的磨耗資料不得直接用於壽命排名。~Combine cutter map, revolutions and geology to calculate travel and compare measured wear for like tools; group outer and center positions separately and do not rank life from records lacking position traceability.||把外緣刀較快磨耗全歸於材料缺陷會錯判供應品質，刀位更換後仍沿用舊行程又會污染趨勢；壽命模型因此對下一段地層失去可比性。~Attributing faster outer wear solely to material defects misjudges quality, while retaining old travel after relocation corrupts trends. The resulting life model loses comparability for the next geological reach.
貫入與每轉進尺~Penetration per revolution||每轉進尺把推進速率與轉速連結，反映刀具每次通過的切入尺度，但它也受岩體裂隙與刀具間距影響。高進尺未必代表高效率，過大載重可能使刀環或軸承提早失效。~Penetration per revolution links advance and rotation to cutting scale, but also depends on fractures and spacing. High penetration is not automatically efficient if excessive load damages cutter rings or bearings prematurely.||假設推進30 mm/min、轉速3 rpm，每轉進尺p=10 mm/rev；未提供刀具容許荷重。~Assume advance 30 mm/min and rotation 3 rpm; penetration p=10 mm/rev, without specifying allowable cutter load.||同步推進、轉速、推力與扭矩，將相同地層與刀具狀態下的區段比較；刀具工程師需核對載重範圍與振動，不能只以提高每轉進尺作績效目標。~Synchronize advance, rotation, thrust and torque and compare intervals with similar geology and tool condition; cutter engineers check loads and vibration instead of treating greater penetration per revolution as the sole performance objective.||轉速讀值或里程時間不一致會製造假高進尺，軟弱帶自然崩解也可能看似切削優秀；若據此增加荷重，進入硬岩後可能超出刀具能力。~Unsynchronized speed and distance create false high penetration, while weak-ground disintegration can mimic excellent cutting. Increasing load on that evidence may exceed tool capability when harder ground returns.
推力分配與偏載~Thrust distribution and uneven loading||總推力包含刀具切削、盾體摩擦及其他阻力，除以刀具數只是粗略平均。混合面與刀盤變形會造成偏載，真正限制可能是單刀峰值而非平均，所以需要位置與工況證據。~Total thrust includes cutting, shield friction and other resistance, making division by cutter count only a rough mean. Mixed ground and cutterhead deformation create uneven loads, with individual peaks potentially governing instead of the average.||假設扣除非切削阻力後有效推力10 MN分到40刀，平均250 kN/刀；不等於每刀實際受力。~Assume effective cutting thrust 10 MN after removing other resistance, shared by 40 tools; the mean is 250 kN/tool, not each tool's actual load.||核對總推力與摩擦估算，結合刀位、混合面和可用單刀量測檢查偏載；分析報告列明平均值用途和未量測峰值，不把均分模型當作所有刀具符合能力的證明。~Check thrust and friction estimates against cutter positions, mixed-face geometry and available individual measurements; state the mean's limited use and unresolved peaks instead of treating equal sharing as proof of adequate capacity everywhere.||少數刀先接觸硬塊時可能承受高衝擊而平均推力正常，若忽略偏載便無法解釋局部刀環崩裂；盲目增加總推力可能使問題惡化。~A few tools meeting a hard inclusion can suffer high impact with normal mean thrust. Ignoring uneven loading leaves localized ring fracture unexplained and may worsen it through increased total thrust.
切削比能與條件~Specific cutting energy and conditions||扭矩功除以開挖體積得到旋轉比能，可比較破岩代價但不包含全部系統能耗。磨耗、節理及運碴再研磨都會影響它，必須將機械狀態和地質相符的區段放在一起比較。~Rotational work per excavated volume measures cutting cost but excludes other system energy. Wear, joints and regrinding affect it, requiring matched geological and mechanical conditions for meaningful comparisons.||假設平均扭矩2 MN·m、轉10圈、開挖20 m³，E=2πTn/V=6.283 MJ/m³，僅旋轉部分。~Assume mean torque 2 MN·m, 10 revolutions and excavation 20 m³; E=2πTn/V=6.283 MJ/m³ for rotation only.||將扭矩積分與實測開挖體積核對，標記停機、空轉及換刀，對照碴片尺寸與地質；比能突升先查多種成因，再由刀具與地工人員決定是否需要獨立檢查。~Check integrated torque work against measured excavation volume and mark stops, idle rotation and replacements; compare chips and geology and investigate competing causes before cutter and geotechnical specialists select further checks.||運碴不良造成重複碾碎會抬高比能，若誤當岩石變硬便可能錯調推力；出土體積估錯又讓能量指標看似改善而實際效率下降。~Poor muck removal raises energy through regrinding and may be misread as harder rock. Incorrect excavated volume can conversely make the energy index appear better while actual efficiency deteriorates.
磨耗率與地層分段~Wear rate by geological reach||刀環徑向損失反映磨蝕，但壽命並非沿全程固定線性；礦物、顆粒與含水改變會使速率跳變。計算前需把更換和刀位移動分開，且保留接近極限時的非線性劣化可能。~Radial loss measures abrasion, but life is not uniformly linear along a drive. Mineralogy, grains and water change rates abruptly. Separate replacements and relocation and retain the possibility of accelerated deterioration near a limiting condition.||假設徑向磨耗3 mm歷經600 m，平均0.005 mm/m；此率不能無條件外推到下一岩層。~Assume radial wear 3 mm over 600 m; mean rate is 0.005 mm/m, not transferable unconditionally to the next stratum.||用一致量具和基準量測刀環，將磨耗對里程、轉數和岩性分段圖示；比較相似刀位與材料，壽命外推需由刀具工程師說明穩態假設，不能以全程平均掩蓋短高磨耗區。~Measure with consistent gauges and datum and plot wear against chainage, revolutions and geology; compare like positions and materials and require engineers to justify steady-rate extrapolation rather than hide a short severe zone in a route average.||跨岩性平均會低估磨蝕帶的即時消耗，量具基準改變又會製造假回復；錯誤壽命預估可能讓需要計畫檢查的刀具過晚被辨識。~Averaging across lithologies understates current wear in an abrasive band, while changed measuring datums create false recovery. The resulting life estimate identifies tools requiring planned inspection too late.
刀環磨耗與軸承故障~Ring wear and bearing failure||刀環磨耗是接觸表面的漸進損失，軸承故障則可能使刀具停止滾動並產生滑磨，兩者症狀不同。溫度、聲振和磨耗形態需要合併，不能只量剩餘直徑就判斷可用性。~Ring wear is gradual surface loss, whereas bearing failure can stop rotation and create sliding abrasion. Temperature, vibration and wear shape are complementary, and remaining diameter alone cannot establish tool condition.||假設正常溫度40°C、觀測65°C，升幅25 K；此差只供教學診斷，不是通用軸承警戒值。~Assume normal temperature 40°C and observation 65°C; the rise is 25 K, a diagnostic illustration rather than a universal bearing alarm.||比較同工況刀具的溫度與振動基線，檢查平磨面、偏磨及轉動狀態的核准檢查紀錄；設備主管需區分散熱環境和軸承異常，所有接近刀盤檢查遵守專業安全程序。~Compare temperature and vibration baselines under matched conditions with approved records of flat spots, uneven wear and rotation; equipment leads distinguish cooling changes from bearing faults, with cutterhead access restricted to specialist procedures.||卡死刀具會由滾動變滑動，局部發熱和刀環損失加速，總扭矩初期卻未必明顯；只靠平均刀盤訊號可能漏掉早期單刀故障。~A seized tool slides rather than rolls, accelerating heat and local wear while total torque may initially change little. Average cutterhead signals can therefore miss the early failure of one cutter.
衝擊與混合面循環~Impact and mixed-face cycling||刀具每轉穿越硬軟界面會反覆載入卸載，平均力無法代表疲勞與衝擊。界面位置、硬塊尺寸和旋轉速度共同控制循環數與幅值，需把事件和刀位路徑對齊。~Crossing a hard-soft interface repeatedly loads and unloads a tool. Mean force cannot represent fatigue and impact; interface position, inclusion size and rotation together control cycling, requiring events to be aligned with cutter trajectories.||假設每轉有2次硬軟轉換、轉速3 rpm、持續100 h，轉換次數2×3×60×100=36000次。~Assume 2 transitions per revolution at 3 rpm over 100 h; transition count is 2×3×60×100=36000.||利用地質面形與旋轉訊號對照週期性衝擊，保留高頻資料而非僅班平均；刀具工程師依實際載荷幅和材料資料評估損傷，循環數本身不能換成未經驗證的剩餘壽命。~Compare face geometry with rotation-synchronized impacts and retain high-frequency records rather than shift means; specialists assess damage using actual amplitudes and material data, not cycle count alone as an unvalidated remaining-life prediction.||取樣頻率不足會把衝擊平均掉，刀具卻持續承受疲勞；只統計轉數又忽略硬軟界面轉換，可能誤把局部崩裂當成偶然製造缺陷。~Slow sampling averages impacts away while fatigue continues. Counting revolutions without interface crossings may wrongly classify localized chipping as a random manufacturing defect rather than repeated loading.
刀間距與碴片形成~Cutter spacing and chip formation||相鄰刀槽之間的裂縫若能連通，岩石以較大碴片剝離；間距、貫入與岩性不匹配時會變成重複研磨。幾何比只描述相對尺度，不能不經試驗就轉成通用最佳刀間距。~Connected cracks between neighboring tracks release larger chips, while mismatched spacing, penetration and rock behavior promote regrinding. A geometry ratio describes relative scale without establishing a universal optimum spacing absent testing.||假設刀間距80 mm、貫入10 mm，比值s/p=8；相同比值在不同岩性不保證相同比能。~For assumed spacing 80 mm and penetration 10 mm, s/p=8; the same ratio in different rocks does not guarantee equal specific energy.||對照代表岩樣切削試驗、碴片粒徑與實際刀盤配置，記錄岩體節理影響；幾何變更由設計和刀具團隊評估，不能從算例比值直接要求現場改裝刀盤。~Compare representative cutting tests, chip sizes and actual cutter layout while documenting joints; design and tool teams assess geometry changes, and the example ratio must not directly drive a field cutterhead modification.||粉碴增加可能表示研磨、磨鈍或岩性改變，不能一律歸於間距不當；若只追求大碴片也可能忽略排碴能力和混合面衝擊的限制。~More fines may indicate regrinding, blunt tools or changed geology rather than spacing alone. Maximizing chip size can also neglect muck-handling capacity and impact limitations in mixed ground.
刀具身份與維修追溯~Tool identity and maintenance traceability||同一刀具可能在不同位置使用並經維修，序號、刀位與時間共同決定實際歷程。更換刀環不一定重置軸承壽命，資料庫必須分辨組件層級，否則新舊零件會混成同一壽命樣本。~A tool may be relocated and rebuilt, making serial number, position and time jointly essential. Replacing a ring does not necessarily reset bearing life; component-level records prevent new and old parts being combined as one lifetime sample.||假設刀環使用400 h更換、軸承此前已200 h，若軸承未換則累積600 h，不是400 h或零。~Assume a ring is replaced after 400 h while its bearing already had 200 h; an unchanged bearing has accumulated 600 h, not 400 h or zero.||抽查刀位圖與序號、維修單、照片和量測紀錄能否互相連接，重建組件累積里程；資料負責人與維修主管共同確認重置規則，缺失歷程需標示不確定而非補寫理想值。~Audit links among cutter map, serials, maintenance sheets, photographs and measurements and reconstruct component exposure; data and maintenance leads approve reset rules, flagging missing history instead of filling it with idealized values.||序號抄錯會把早期故障歸到另一批次，更換整刀與只換刀環未區分則誇大或低估壽命；供應比較和備件計畫都會被錯誤歷程影響。~A wrong serial assigns early failure to the wrong batch, while conflating complete-tool and ring-only replacement distorts life. Supplier comparisons and spare planning then inherit the same erroneous history.
維護決策與檢查界線~Maintenance decisions and access boundaries||刀具維護需整合剩餘厚度、軸承狀態、預測地層與可檢查窗口，不能由單一磨耗率自動決定。資料驅動判讀只支持專業決策，刀盤或加壓艙的接近仍是獨立的高風險核准工作。~Maintenance combines remaining section, bearing condition, predicted ground and inspection opportunities rather than one wear rate. Data supports professional decisions, while access to a cutterhead or pressurized chamber remains a separately approved specialist task.||假設40刀中36刀有最新有效狀態，覆蓋90%；其餘4刀若位於同一高負荷區，不能以整體比例忽略。~If 36 of an assumed 40 cutters have current valid condition records, coverage is 90%; 4 missing tools in a high-load zone cannot be dismissed by the overall percentage.||以刀位風險圖核對資料新鮮度、地質預測和維護紀錄，將未確認刀具單列；維修及施工負責人依核准計畫安排檢查，課程不提供進艙、換刀或解除隔離的操作步驟。~Review data freshness, ground prediction and maintenance on a position-risk map, listing unconfirmed tools; maintenance and construction leads plan inspections under approved arrangements, with no chamber-entry or tool-change procedure supplied here.||只按平均磨耗安排檢查可能漏掉一顆卡死刀具，預測模型若未更新新岩層也會過度樂觀；忽略這些限制會讓規劃數字被誤當現場許可。~Average-wear scheduling can miss one seized tool, and an unupdated ground model gives optimistic forecasts. Ignoring these limits can turn planning numbers into mistakenly assumed authorization for field work.
''')
 compact('b140','把環片永久受力、製造品質與暫態施工荷載連成完整驗證鏈~Connect permanent segment behavior, manufacturing quality and temporary construction loads',['hs2-segments','crossrail-fire'],r'''
全環與局部荷載~Ring and local load cases||預鑄環片完成閉環後承受土水載重，運輸、組裝與推進時卻有不同邊界和集中力。永久環分析不能包辦所有階段，需建立從工廠到受力成環的荷載路徑清單，逐項確認最不利狀態。~A closed segmental ring carries ground and water loads, while transport, assembly and thrust impose different restraints and concentrated forces. Permanent-ring analysis cannot cover every stage; trace load paths from factory to completed ring.||假設薄環均勻外壓p=0.3 MPa、半徑3 m，環向膜力N=pR=0.9 MN/m；不含彎矩及接縫。~Assume uniform pressure p=0.3 MPa on a thin ring of radius 3 m; membrane force N=pR=0.9 MN/m, excluding bending and joints.||將永久、堆放、運輸與推進荷載分列計算工況，檢查支承位置與實際程序一致；以代表性構件試驗或核准分析驗證，任何暫態工況不能因永久承載合格而省略。~List permanent, storage, transport and thrust cases with supports matching actual arrangements; verify through appropriate component tests or approved analysis, retaining temporary cases even when permanent capacity is adequate.||環片在工廠完好卻可能於運輸支點附近開裂，之後裂縫影響水密與耐久；若只審查成環土壓，這種施工階段損傷沒有被設計覆蓋。~Segments sound at the factory may crack near transport supports and later lose watertightness or durability. Reviewing only completed-ring earth pressure leaves that construction-stage damage outside the design assessment.
材料批次與強度~Material batches and strength||混凝土強度受配料、含氣、養護和試體代表性影響，單一高強度試塊不代表整批均勻。環片還需控制韌性、密實與尺寸，強度數字只是品質鏈的一部分而非全部驗收證據。~Concrete strength depends on batching, air, curing and specimen representativeness. One high result does not prove a uniform batch, and toughness, compaction and dimensions remain separate parts of segment quality.||假設三個抗壓試值48、50、52 MPa，平均50 MPa；此小樣本平均不是規範特徵強度。~Assumed compressive results 48,50 and 52 MPa average 50 MPa; this small-sample mean is not a code-defined characteristic strength.||核對材料批號、拌合與養護紀錄，將試體時間和對應環片連結；依合約試驗方法評估批次分布，異常值須查成因而非直接刪除，製造及品質主管共同確認處置。~Link material, mixing and curing records to specimens and segments by time; evaluate batch distributions under the contract test method and investigate anomalies rather than deleting them, with joint production and quality review.||試塊養護優於環片會高估實際早齡能力，批號混淆又使低強度件無法追溯；即使平均合格，局部蜂窩和裂縫仍可能控制使用性。~Better specimen curing than segment curing overstates early capacity, while batch confusion prevents tracing weak pieces. A satisfactory mean does not rule out local honeycombing or cracking governing serviceability.
纖維與殘餘韌性~Fibres and residual toughness||纖維跨越裂縫後提供殘餘拉力，但效果取決於取向、分布與錨定，不能只由每立方米重量推定。鋼筋和纖維的角色需依設計分清，局部集中力與接縫區仍可能需要專門細節。~Fibres bridge cracks with residual resistance governed by orientation, distribution and anchorage, not dosage alone. Their role relative to reinforcement must be designed, with concentrated loads and joint zones requiring specific detailing.||假設中央單點載重的三點彎曲缺口梁，殘餘荷重12 kN、跨距0.5 m、寬0.15 m、有效韌帶0.125 m，fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa。~Assume a notched beam under three-point centre loading with residual load 12 kN, span 0.5 m, width 0.15 m and ligament 0.125 m; fR=3FL/(2bh²)=3.84 MPa.||依適用梁試驗方法記錄裂縫開口與殘餘荷重，對照取樣方向及纖維分布；設計者需確認試驗值如何轉成構件模型，不能把名義纖維添加量直接當拉力設計值。~Record crack opening and residual load using the applicable beam method and check sample orientation and fibre distribution; designers justify transfer to structural behavior rather than converting nominal dosage directly into tensile capacity.||澆置流向造成纖維取向偏差時，標準梁可能比環片不利方向更強；局部纖維團聚又會留下弱區，只看總添加重量無法發現。~Casting-induced fibre orientation can make test beams stronger than the unfavorable segment direction. Local clustering also leaves weak zones that total dosage records alone cannot reveal reliably.
模具與幾何公差~Moulds and geometric tolerances||環片尺寸決定成環形狀、接縫接觸與止水墊壓縮，累積偏差可能在最後一塊才暴露。模具磨耗及溫度使尺寸隨批次變化，應分辨單件誤差與系統性偏差，不能只檢查能否拼上。~Dimensions control ring shape, joint contact and gasket compression. Accumulated error may appear only at the final piece, while mould wear and temperature introduce batch drift. Distinguish individual and systematic error rather than accepting mere assembly fit.||假設一環6片各有同向弧長偏差0.5 mm，總偏差3 mm；獨立隨機誤差才可用平方根加總。~If an assumed ring has 6 segments each with a same-direction arc-length bias of 0.5 mm, total bias is 3 mm; root-sum-square applies only to independent random errors.||以校準量具或三維量測檢查模具和成品，繪製尺寸隨批次的趨勢並做核准試拼；品質主管須辨識共同偏差，止水溝槽和接觸面公差需與環片設計一致。~Survey moulds and products with calibrated gauges or three-dimensional methods, chart batch trends and perform approved trial assembly; quality review identifies common bias and aligns groove and bearing-face tolerances with design.||同向公差若誤當隨機抵消，閉合片可能被迫擠入而造成邊角裂損；反覆修磨又會改變止水墊溝槽，組裝成功仍不代表水密合格。~Treating systematic tolerances as canceling random errors can force the closing piece and crack edges. Repeated grinding may alter gasket grooves, so successful assembly still does not establish watertightness.
早齡溫差與養護~Early-age temperature and curing||水化升溫與外界冷卻形成溫度梯度，受約束收縮可在強度尚低時引起裂縫。高早強不代表低熱裂風險，需同時看溫度歷程、拘束和濕度，避免把養護只等同抗壓數字。~Hydration and cooling create gradients whose restrained contraction can crack young concrete. High early strength does not eliminate thermal risk; temperature history, restraint and moisture must be reviewed alongside compressive results.||假設α=10⁻⁵/K、E=20 GPa、全約束降溫20 K，彈性拉應力EαΔT=4 MPa；實際徐變會改變結果。~Assume α=10⁻⁵/K, E=20 GPa and fully restrained cooling of 20 K; elastic tensile stress EαΔT=4 MPa, modified in reality by creep.||記錄環片核心和表面溫度、養護濕度及脫模時刻，對照早齡裂縫分布；製造工程師需評估實際拘束與徐變，不能用全約束算例直接判定裂縫一定發生或不發生。~Record core-surface temperature, curing moisture and demoulding time and compare early crack patterns; production engineers assess real restraint and creep rather than treating the fully restrained illustration as a definite crack prediction.||快速冷卻可使表面先收縮開裂，脫模後乾燥又可能疊加收縮；若只看試塊強度達標便結束養護，耐久缺陷可能在交貨後才明顯。~Rapid cooling contracts the surface first, and post-demoulding drying adds shrinkage. Ending curing solely because specimen strength is reached can leave durability defects that become visible only after delivery.
吊運支點與裂縫~Handling supports and cracking||吊運和堆放的支點控制環片暫態彎矩，位置偏差可比重量誤差更敏感。吊點、墊木和構件方向需要由核准方案決定，教學力學只解釋為何同一環片在不同支承下會有不同應力。~Handling and storage supports control transient bending, sometimes more sensitively than weight error. Approved plans govern lifting points, dunnage and orientation; mechanics explains why the same segment develops different stresses under different support arrangements.||假設簡支示意梁總均布載重20 kN、跨2 m，Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m；曲面環片需專門分析。~For an assumed simply supported illustrative beam with total distributed load 20 kN over 2 m, Mmax=WL/8=5 kN·m; curved segments require specific analysis.||核對實際支點與核准圖面，交貨前後保存裂縫和缺角照片並追溯環片序號；吊運由合格團隊按既定程序執行，不能把簡支模型當作吊點選擇或現場操作說明。~Check actual supports against approved drawings and preserve before-after delivery crack photographs by serial; qualified teams follow approved handling procedures, and the simple beam is not a lifting-point selection or operating instruction.||墊木錯位可能在外觀未立即開裂時已形成微裂縫，之後推進荷載使其擴展；無交貨前照片時，很難區分製造、運輸與組裝損傷。~Misplaced dunnage can create microcracking before visible damage, later extended by thrust. Without pre-delivery photographs, manufacturing, transport and assembly damage become difficult to distinguish and address.
推進千斤頂局部承壓~Local jack bearing||推進反力透過千斤頂墊板進入環片，局部承壓與劈裂不等同全環均勻軸力。墊板位置、接觸面和平整度決定擴散路徑，偏載可能讓邊緣先損壞而平均壓力仍合理。~Thrust enters through jack pads, creating local bearing and splitting unlike uniform ring compression. Pad location, contact and flatness govern spreading, and eccentricity can damage an edge despite an acceptable mean pressure.||假設墊板力1 MN、面積0.1 m²，平均承壓10 MPa；不能代替局部劈裂與邊距檢核。~An assumed pad force 1 MN over 0.1 m² gives mean bearing 10 MPa; splitting and edge-distance checks remain separate.||把千斤頂實際接觸位置與環片配筋模型比較，檢查接觸痕跡及邊緣裂縫；依核准分析或試驗檢核局部荷載路徑，設備與結構負責人共同審查不均勻推力。~Compare actual pad positions with reinforcement and analysis, inspecting contact marks and edge cracks; verify local load paths by approved analysis or tests, with joint equipment and structural review of uneven thrust.||墊板只接觸一角會集中壓力並誘發劈裂，總推力除總面積卻可能看似安全；若把裂縫歸於混凝土批次，會漏掉真正的幾何原因。~Corner-only pad contact concentrates pressure and causes splitting while total force divided by total area looks acceptable. Blaming the concrete batch can miss the actual geometric cause of damage.
防火與爆裂驗證~Fire and spalling verification||火災熱傳、孔壓與材料退化會共同影響環片，表面爆裂使有效厚度減少並暴露配筋。材料小試與足尺受載試驗回答不同問題，防火策略需依隧道用途和設計火災情境評估。~Fire combines heat transfer, pore pressure and material degradation. Spalling reduces effective thickness and exposes reinforcement. Small material tests and loaded full-scale tests answer different questions, requiring a scenario appropriate to tunnel use.||假設熱擴散率a=10⁻⁶ m²/s、時間3600 s，尺度√(at)=0.06 m；不等於爆裂深度或耐火厚度。~Assume thermal diffusivity a=10⁻⁶ m²/s over 3600 s; √(at)=0.06 m is a diffusion scale, not spalling depth or required fire thickness.||核對設計火災曲線、受載狀態、含水及試件尺寸，保留溫度、爆裂和殘餘承載資料；防火工程師依核准性能目標審查，不把單一試驗照片或擴散尺度當耐火認證。~Check fire curve, loading, moisture and specimen scale and retain temperature, spalling and residual capacity; fire specialists review approved performance objectives rather than treating one photograph or diffusion scale as certification.||把無載小試直接代表受壓環片可能低估爆裂或接縫效應，保護層局部剝落又使鋼筋快速升溫；忽略試驗邊界會產生錯誤耐火結論。~An unloaded small test may underrepresent spalling or joint effects in loaded segments. Local cover loss also heats steel rapidly, making unexamined test boundaries a source of false fire-resistance conclusions.
耐久擴散與保護層~Durability diffusion and cover||離子與水分進入混凝土的速度受孔隙結構、裂縫和接縫影響，完好材料的擴散模型不能涵蓋所有快速通道。保護層需兼顧製造公差與裂縫控制，不能只依名義厚度預測壽命。~Moisture and ions enter through matrix pores, cracks and joints. Intact-material diffusion misses preferential paths, so cover must consider manufacturing tolerance and cracking rather than predicting life from nominal thickness alone.||假設純擴散尺度t≈x²/D，x由40增50 mm，其餘相同，時間比(50/40)²=1.5625；非壽命保證。~Under assumed diffusion scaling t≈x²/D, increasing x from 40 to 50 mm gives time ratio 1.5625 at unchanged D, not a service-life guarantee.||量測實際保護層、裂縫及吸水或遷移試驗指標，對照暴露環境和接縫細節；耐久設計需分列材料擴散與裂縫通道，評估試驗加速條件如何轉換到使用期。~Measure actual cover, cracking and absorption or migration indices against exposure and joint details; separate matrix transport from crack pathways and justify transfer from accelerated tests to service conditions.||局部保護層不足或貫穿裂縫會主導劣化，平均厚度合格仍可能出現早期鏽蝕；以完好材料係數算出長壽命，無法彌補未處理快速通道。~Local thin cover or through-cracks can govern early corrosion despite an acceptable mean. A long life calculated with intact-material coefficients does not compensate for unaddressed preferential transport paths.
環片序號與品質交接~Segment serials and quality handover||環片從模具、材料批次到組裝位置形成長資料鏈，任何環節失去身份都會削弱缺陷追蹤。交接應讓一個裂縫回到製造和運輸事件，也讓異常批次找到所有已安裝位置。~Segments form a data chain from mould and batch to installed position. Lost identity impairs defect tracing; handover must connect a crack to manufacturing and handling events and locate every installed piece from an affected batch.||假設一批120片有118片可完整追溯，比例98.33%；缺失2片不能因整體比例高而自動驗收。~If 118 of an assumed 120 segments are fully traceable, the rate is 98.33%; the remaining 2 do not qualify automatically because the overall rate is high.||抽取已裝環片逆查材料、試驗、尺寸、修補與運輸單，另由批號正查安裝位置；品質主管將缺漏和限制逐件簽認，數位掃碼成功不等於資料內容已通過工程審查。~Trace installed pieces backward through materials, tests, dimensions, repairs and transport, and trace batches forward to locations; quality leads resolve gaps individually, since successful scanning does not constitute engineering acceptance of content.||重複序號或替換未登記會把缺陷批次定位到錯誤環，資料完整表象反而增加誤信；只有可雙向追溯的鏈才能支援針對性檢查與維護。~Duplicate serials or undocumented substitutions locate defective batches in the wrong ring, creating false confidence from apparent completeness. Only bidirectional traceability supports targeted inspection and subsequent maintenance.
''')
